  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 Gap Year是我的一次空仓投资</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633f29e59186d4e4c46a0bb2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633f29e59186d4e4c46a0bb2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Oct 2022 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>串台节目！谢谢《岂有此理》圆了我被访谈的梦想，当时的我处在gap第10个月即将离开北京之际。本期的制作、剪辑、导语、时间线都由@龙婧 完成，再次感谢之余不惊感叹，被访真是比做主持人轻松愉快一百倍。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>导语：</span></strong><span>断档俩月，一期姗姗来迟的节目。因为切换工作/城市，期间gap了三个月，也借此机会邀请到正在gap year项目中的松松。我们一起聊聊关于gap的独特体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>gap作为一种生活方式的选择，只是生命中无数的探索之一，其实都始于我们想要更加了解自己&amp;感知他人&amp;体验世界。你是否也做过或想象过，类似间隔年的探索呢？祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>邵松松（即刻、公众号@邵松松/播客《野生记者》），一个不工作第14个月的摸鱼猪，每天东摸摸西摸摸，好像一整年什么正事也没干🤷‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【你可能会听到】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 龙婧《岂有此理》X 邵松松《野生记者》串台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 选择gap的起因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> 给gap year项目打个分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 我的规划就是没有规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 谈谈用自媒体做IP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 什么样的人/情况更适合gap</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 如何保持旺盛的表达能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> 播客创作的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3142">52:22</a> 聊一聊社交能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3314">55:14</a> 谢谢北京，告别北京</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【背景音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*My Secret Life - Leonard Cohen</span></p><span></span><p><span>*Young Wild &amp; Free - Snoop Dogg, Wiz Khalifa, Bruno Mars</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗</span><strong><span>岂有此理 友台链接🔗：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6289c91983ddae2d9e72a8fb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6289c91983ddae2d9e72a8fb"><span>Ep06. 投资一个gap year项目，做人生的体验派</span></a></p>]]></description>
