  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 弗拉门戈，痛苦何以具像化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633f29d72a992d56e91e56a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633f29d72a992d56e91e56a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Oct 2022 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>除去红裙的吉普赛女郎这一典型意向，弗拉门戈还是流浪人的弗拉门戈，底层人民的弗拉门戈，脱胎于小酒馆的弗拉门戈，它有现今艳丽热烈的外表，也有历史带来的黑暗内核，这也就是这一种舞蹈与众不同的魅力之处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期就请到我西语课的同学Jane，她在学习弗拉门戈近十年的过程中，完成了从主业出版编辑业余舞校学生到弗拉门戈授课编舞老师的职业转变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一直好奇为什么是Flamenco与她相伴如此久，直到有一天我俩在王府井大街上坐着吃着冰淇淋，突然聊悟了，Jane说可能她从小学画画，她对于舞蹈者的肢体语言，那些线条有着天然的直觉。而弗拉门戈连接起了情绪与具象表达。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Jane，base北京的弗拉门戈舞蹈老师。学过画画，公共艺术本科，也学过fashion marketing，曾做过出版社编辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【你可能会听到】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 弗拉门戈是什么，为什么与弗拉门戈结缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 弗拉门戈的历史：内核是黑色的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 一种表达情绪的舞蹈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 弗拉门戈是一种语言：吉他手、音乐、舞者三者的配合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 弗拉门戈小课堂（四大曲调、服饰、道具、为什么出现大红裙摆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2804">46:44</a> 为什么上了年纪的老妇人在弗拉门戈中更受欢迎？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【资料补充】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、纪录片</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zx411L7Ph/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=F2261CC6-DECC-4682-B737-CA6FB31AE9DD&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648642700&amp;unique_k=C9sWVlE&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zx411L7Ph/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=F2261CC6-DECC-4682-B737-CA6FB31AE9DD&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648642700&amp;unique_k=C9sWVlE&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d"><span>《Flamenco, Flamenco》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2、TED</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16v411p7jU/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=97067EFA-1A85-4D15-A64E-A48889A059E8&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648652984&amp;unique_k=mKw9mWP&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16v411p7jU/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=97067EFA-1A85-4D15-A64E-A48889A059E8&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648652984&amp;unique_k=mKw9mWP&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d"><span>TED x Fulbright 弗拉门戈是一门语言</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1j44y1Y7xM/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=E48779B5-FDDA-4210-AA30-DCAAA1A69927&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651210&amp;unique_k=FmBY7oj&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1j44y1Y7xM/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=E48779B5-FDDA-4210-AA30-DCAAA1A69927&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651210&amp;unique_k=FmBY7oj&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d"><span>TED x Madrid - Rocío Molina - Soy impura, soy danzaora（我不纯洁，我是舞者）</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3、弗拉门戈欣赏：</span></strong><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wE411b7Ls/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=D0723C51-3004-48C6-A2D8-95F391DF678D&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651730&amp;unique_k=xI1vTU3&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wE411b7Ls/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=D0723C51-3004-48C6-A2D8-95F391DF678D&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651730&amp;unique_k=xI1vTU3&amp;share_times=2&amp;vd_source=adc289a23d457f59bf9a8775d1ef4a5d"><span>Tangos del Titi 致敬版</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NK4y1p7Xp/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=C69508BD-0B45-46AE-91C0-E28F05523D2B&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651570&amp;unique_k=BKg3LIN&amp;share_times=2" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NK4y1p7Xp/?p=1&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=C69508BD-0B45-46AE-91C0-E28F05523D2B&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1648651570&amp;unique_k=BKg3LIN&amp;share_times=2"><span>西班牙舞者Fuensanta Blanco跳的弗拉门戈Tangos</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>【背景音乐】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>* Andalucia - Johannes Linstead</span></p><span></span><h2><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>【关于野生记者】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>一个泛艺术、人文、科技的对话节目。讨论关于美、关于个人成长、关于自我觉察的种种。主播邵松松。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在小宇宙/苹果播客/Spotify/喜马拉雅 同步收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系请邮件：songsong_shao@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>不定期文字版见公众号：邵松松</span></p>]]></description>
